# The input Dependabot re-resolves requirements-test.lock.txt from (LL-030, ADR-0019). It is what
# requirements.lock.in says plus pyproject.toml's [project.optional-dependencies] test, so the file
# it compiles to holds the shipped dependencies and the test-only ones, pinned and hashed together:
# that is what `pytest` runs against in CI. tests/test_ll030_locked_test_env.py fails if this file
# and pyproject.toml differ, or if the two locks disagree on a version. To re-lock by hand instead,
# the command in requirements-test.lock.txt's header still works.
